    <string name="service_label">Rokoreels</string>
    <string name="service_description">Counts the short videos you swipe through in Instagram Reels, YouTube Shorts, Snapchat Spotlight, TikTok, Moj and Josh, shows Iris while you watch, and takes you out of them when you reach your daily limit or your focus hours. It looks only at which screen is open, reads no text or messages, and never sends what\'s on your screen anywhere.</string>

